  - pipeline-monitoring
  - literature-search
  - arxiv
  - openalex
  - crossref
  - joss
  - research-software
  - evidence-gated-retrieval
abstract: >-
  LAPPATO_MCB is a Python library with no third-party runtime
  dependencies that reads the diagnostic files a machine-learning
  pipeline writes to a checkpoints/ folder, activates manifest-defined
  weakness detectors when measured evidence crosses documented
  thresholds, and retrieves targeted scientific literature from arXiv,
  OpenAlex, Crossref and JOSS. It ships 35 domain manifests with 193
  detectors (155 evidence-gated, 38 structural), offline replay from a
  local corpus, a pluggable reranker interface with a standard-library
  baseline, and an optional Model Context Protocol server.
version: "1.7.0"
